  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n2x2 + 5x - 1 = 0\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a - b)³ = a³ - b³ - 3ab(a - b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n2x² + 5x - 1 = 0\n\nDivide the equation by 2x, we get\n\n(2x²/x) + (5x/2x) - (1/2x) = 0\n\n⇒ x + (5/2) - (1/2x) = 0\n\n⇒ x - (1/2x) = -5/2 ---- (1)\n\nNow a = x, b = (1/2x)\n\nSo, (-5/2)³ = (x³) - (1/2x)³ - 3 × x × (1/2x) (x - 1/2x)\n\n⇒ -125/8 = x³ - (1/8x³) - (3/2) (-5/2) (From 1)\n\n⇒ -125/8 = x³ - (1/8x³) + (15/4)\n\n⇒ (-125/8) - (15/4) = x³ - (1/8x³)\n\n⇒ (-125 - 30)/8 = x³ - (1/8x³)\n\n⇒ -155/8 = x³ - (1/8x³)\n\n**∴ The value of x³ - (1)/({8{x³)}} is -155/8.**",
